research/audit/wave10-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-11718-          "claim": "By [L5] and [L7], for $i < N = 3M$ the lower value is $m_i = g(t_i) = \\lfloor \\iota(i)/\\iota(M)\\rfloor$, which is $0$ for $i < M$, $1$ for $M \\le i < 2M$ and $2$ for $2M \\le i < 3M$; and the upper value is $M_i = g(t_{i+1}) = \\lfloor \\iota(i+1)/\\iota(M)\\rfloor$, which is $0$ for $i+1 < M$, $1$ for $M \\le i+1 < 2M$, $2$ for $2M \\le i+1 < 3M$ and $3$ for $i+1 = 3M$. [given, L1, L4, L5, L7]",
research/audit/wave10-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-11719-          "step": "1.2",
