research/audit/wave10-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json:11728:          "id": "ex-integral-of-the-floor-function-step-2-1",
research/audit/wave10-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-11729-          "claim": "By [L6] and step 1.2, $L(g,U_N) = \\frac{1}{\\iota(M)}\\Bigl(\\sum_{i<M}0 + \\sum_{M \\le i < 2M}1 + \\sum_{2M \\le i < 3M}2\\Bigr) = \\frac{1}{\\iota(M)}\\bigl(0 + \\iota(M) + 2\\iota(M)\\bigr) = 3$. [step 1.2, L4, L5, L6, L9]",
research/audit/wave10-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-11730-          "step": "2.1",
