research/audit/wave10-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json:11740:          "id": "ex-integral-of-the-floor-function-step-2-2",
research/audit/wave10-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-11741-          "claim": "By [L6] and step 1.2, the upper values run over $j = i+1$ from $1$ to $3M$, giving $\\iota(M)-1$ indices with value $0$, then $\\iota(M)$ with value $1$, then $\\iota(M)$ with value $2$, and the single index $j = 3M$ with value $3$; hence $U(g,U_N) = \\frac{1}{\\iota(M)}\\bigl(0 + \\iota(M) + 2\\iota(M) + 3\\bigr) = 3 + \\frac{3}{\\iota(M)}$. [step 1.2, L4, L5, L6, L9]",
research/audit/wave10-real-analysis.proof-contracts.json-11742-          "step": "2.2",
